<title>VENEZUELA: Venezuelan bolivar ends flat in quiet trade.</title>
<headline>Venezuelan bolivar ends flat in quiet trade.</headline>
<dateline>CARACAS 1997-03-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Venezuelan bolivar closed flat at 476.50/477.50 per dollar in a quiet day's trade that saw little movement in the exchange rate, traders said.</p>
<p>The unit closed Thursday at 476.50/477.50 per dollar.</p>
<p>&quot;The Central Bank sold dollars into the market, and when the price dropped there were some corporate clients,&quot; said one trader. &quot;But it was a very quiet day,&quot; he added.</p>
<p>((-- Ana Isabel Martinez, Caracas newsroom, 582 505 2600))</p>
</text>
